							<div class="kdm-faq-body">
								<p class="kdm-faq-answer"><span class="kdm-ans-badge">Ans</span> Mobile app promotion is the strategic combination of App Store Optimization (ASO), paid user acquisition campaigns, influencer marketing, and retention funnels designed to maximize app downloads, active user retention, and in-app revenue. With millions of applications on Google Play Store and Apple App Store, strategic app promotion ensures your app stands out, outranks competitors, and acquires high-lifetime-value (LTV) users.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- FAQ 2 -->
						<div class="kdm-faq-item">
							<button type="button" class="kdm-faq-header">
								<span class="kdm-faq-question">Q.2. What is App Store Optimization (ASO) and how does it help?</span>
								<span class="kdm-faq-icon">+</span>
							</button>
							<div class="kdm-faq-body">
								<p class="kdm-faq-answer"><span class="kdm-ans-badge">Ans</span> ASO is the process of optimizing mobile app visibility in app stores by targeting high-volume search keywords in titles, subtitles, and descriptions, while designing high-converting app icons, screenshots, and preview videos. Effective ASO increases organic app discovery and drives continuous, cost-free installs.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- FAQ 3 -->
						<div class="kdm-faq-item">
