								<p class="kdm-faq-answer"><span class="kdm-ans-badge">Ans</span> We deploy multi-channel user acquisition campaigns across Google Universal App Campaigns (UAC on Google Search, Play Store, YouTube, Display), Apple Search Ads (ASA), Meta Ads (Facebook &amp; Instagram App Install Ads), TikTok Ads, LinkedIn Ads, programmatic CPI networks, and direct influencer marketing.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- FAQ 4 -->
						<div class="kdm-faq-item">
							<button type="button" class="kdm-faq-header">
								<span class="kdm-faq-question">Q.4. How do you track app installs and in-app user actions accurately?</span>
