							</button>
							<div class="kdm-faq-body">
								<p class="kdm-faq-answer"><span class="kdm-ans-badge">Ans</span> We integrate Mobile Measurement Partners (MMP) such as AppsFlyer, Adjust, Branch, Singular, alongside Google Firebase and Meta App SDK. This enables exact tracking of installs, in-app registrations, subscription purchases, level achievements, and deep-link campaign attribution.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- FAQ 5 -->
						<div class="kdm-faq-item">
							<button type="button" class="kdm-faq-header">
								<span class="kdm-faq-question">Q.5. Can you promote both Android (Google Play) and iOS (Apple App Store) apps?</span>
