							<div class="kdm-faq-body">
								<p class="kdm-faq-answer"><span class="kdm-ans-badge">Ans</span> We implement strict SDK-level anti-fraud filters, device ID validation, time-to-install (TTI) anomaly detection, and optimize campaigns toward post-install engagement events rather than cheap raw downloads to ensure 100% genuine, human users.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

